│ patch_description        │ This approach implements a dual-basis rotation strategy combined with hybrid entanglement │
│                          │ topology. By using independent RY and RX rotation layers, the ansatz ensures high         │
│                          │ expressivity across different bases, which is critical given the IsingZZ (diagonal)       │
│                          │ nature of the fixed feature map. The entanglement strategy combines a nearest-neighbor    │
│                          │ CNOT ring for local correlation and long-range CZ "star" connections (distance-4) to      │
│                          │ facilitate global information flow across the 8-qubit register. This specific parameter   │
│                          │ budget (16 parameters per block, 98 total) is chosen to maximize validation accuracy      │
│                          │ while maintaining training stability, building on the observation that balanced,          │
│                          │ independent parameter layers outperformed highly constrained sharing in previous          │
│                          │ iterations.                                                                               │
