│                          │ - a small mixed-axis controlled-rotation core (CRX/CRY/CRZ) for expressive nonlinear      │
│                          │ mixing,                                                                                   │
│                          │ - mirrored shared RZ post-rotations to refine readout-sensitive phases.                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The result preserves the same training loop and I/O, but should reduce overfitting        │
│                          │ relative to the larger ansatz while retaining enough expressivity for fast convergence.   │
