│ patch_description        │ This edit replaces the current 16-parameter-per-block mirror-symmetric circuit with a     │
│                          │ more compact 12-parameter ansatz that previously showed stronger efficiency: shared       │
│                          │ pre-rotations, a fixed entangling CZ scaffold, a small mixed-axis controlled-rotation     │
│                          │ core, and shared post-phase refinements.                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The main goal is to improve the combined score by lowering parameter count and reducing   │
│                          │ overfitting pressure while keeping expressive nonlocal mixing through the controlled      │
│                          │ rotations and the existing fixed feature map. This should move the model toward the       │
│                          │ better-performing, more parameter-efficient regime without changing any of the fixed      │
│                          │ training or measurement code.                                                             │
