│ patch_name               │ mirrored_crz_injection                                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ This edit implements a more parameter-efficient and expressive ansatz by following two    │
│                          │ strategies:                                                                               │
│                          │ 1. Replacing the four fixed long-range CZ gates with mirror-shared CRZ rotations (2       │
│                          │ parameters per block). This tunable entanglement allows the circuit to better adapt to    │
│                          │ the IsingZZ feature map's correlations.                                                   │
│                          │ 2. Applying mirror symmetry to the input RY layer, reducing the per-block input parameter │
│                          │ count from 8 to 4.                                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ These changes reduce the total parameter count from 98 to 86 while increasing the         │
│                          │ expressive power of the entangling layer, which is expected to improve the combined score │
│                          │ by enhancing parameter efficiency and potentially improving validation accuracy.          │
