│ patch_name               │ simplify_and_entangle                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ The previous iteration attempted to increase expressivity by parametrizing the long-range │
│                          │ entanglers (CRZ) and adding extra single-qubit RX rotations. However, this increased the  │
│                          │ gate count and validation loss, resulting in a significantly lower combined score         │
│                          │ compared to the seed.                                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit restores the more efficient entangling structure of the seed while refining the │
│                          │ mirrored parameter sharing to maximize efficiency. Specifically:                          │
│                          │ 1. It reverts long-range and local entanglers to fixed CZ gates to minimize parameter     │
│                          │ noise and reduce gate count (252 vs 276).                                                 │
│                          │ 2. It replaces the inefficient single-qubit RX layer with a more powerful mirrored        │
│                          │ CRX/CRY core, which facilitates better inter-qubit correlation with the same parameter    │
│                          │ budget.                                                                                   │
│                          │ 3. It maintains mirror-symmetric RY input and RZ output layers for calibrated feature     │
│                          │ lifting and readout.                                                                      │
│                          │ 4. The total parameter count remains 74, matching the seed's complexity but optimizing    │
│                          │ the gate placement.                                                                       │
