│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ enhanced_entanglement_with_intermediate_interactions                                      │
│ patch_description        │ The previous recommendation to tie repeat parameters requires modifying the fixed         │
│                          │ training loop outside the EVOLVE-BLOCK, which is immutable. Instead, I propose improving  │
│                          │ ANSATZ_SPEC directly to address the observed performance drop (validation_accuracy: 0.91  │
│                          │ → 0.88, combined_score: 0.27 → 0.15).                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **Analysis:**                                                                             │
│                          │ The current program has higher test accuracy (0.89 vs 0.87) but lower validation accuracy │
│                          │ (0.88 vs 0.91), indicating potential overfitting or suboptimal feature extraction. The    │
│                          │ validation loss increased from 0.39 to 0.45.                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **Proposed improvement:**                                                                 │
│                          │ Add intermediate multi-qubit interactions that bridge the input layer and                 │
│                          │ controlled-rotation core, improving information mixing while keeping the same 12          │
│                          │ parameters per block. Specifically:                                                       │
│                          │ - Keep the efficient input RY layer with mirror symmetry (4 params)                       │
│                          │ - Enhance the entanglement scaffold with additional strategic interactions before the     │
│                          │ core rotations                                                                            │
│                          │ - Maintain the output RZ layer with mirror symmetry (4 params)                            │
│                          │ - Restructure the core to add CRX complementary to CRY/CRZ for better axis coverage (4    │
│                          │ params)                                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This balances expressivity and regularization to improve validation generalization while  │
│                          │ preserving parameter efficiency.                                                          │
